@startuml getLogicalTerminationPointAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getLogicalTerminationPointAsync – Retrieve Logical Termination Point by UUID
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ControlConstruct" as ccRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - logicalTerminationPointUuid
end note

requestor -> ccRes: (logicalTerminationPointUuid)
activate ccRes

ccRes -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> ccRes: list of LTPs
deactivate jd

note over ccRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through all LTPs  
  - Match each LTP's UUID with 
    input logicalTerminationPointUuid  
  - Return the LTP object if found  
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

ccRes --> requestor: LTP object | undefined
deactivate ccRes

@enduml
